{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Violet is determined to save her broken marriage \u2013 at any cost!</strong><br>In search of lost mementos, she wanders through a dark and twisted forest that shifts with every step. The deeper Violet goes, the stranger everything becomes \u2013 and the line between reality and madness begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/9136c82acaec2c81f1de47b5eca34f86.avif?t=1757266180\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost in the Woods</strong> is a 2D exploration game with visual novel elements that takes you deep into a haunting, surreal forest. Explore the environment, interact with strange objects, make choices \u2013 and discover what\u2019s real\u2026 and what\u2019s not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/319e164c6ed5575ff76f86413c29a9c4.avif?t=1757266180\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmospheric short story about toxic love, loss, and the slow unraveling of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D exploration in a surreal, shifting forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel segments with two possible endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological and surreal narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark atmosphere and subtle horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through reality, memory, and madness</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815140?t=1757266180","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steams